        "node_id": "n_2_8eb764",
        "thought_text": "The current approach incorrectly assumes that if the white sheet is not covered by either black sheet, it can be seen. This is not always the case, as there might be a point inside the white sheet that is not covered by the black sheets. A better approach would be to check if there exists at least one point inside the white sheet that is not covered by either of the black sheets.",
